  published OpenAPI specification and TypeScript SDK in https://github.com/Raza-Abbas32/evorozen-sdk
  (MIT License) and the documentation at https://pulse.evorozen.com/docs. No SDK code is vendored.
  Neural Pulse is a product of Evorozen; use of the API is subject to Evorozen's terms.

